repository contributors

This repository is a mixed research package. The license below applies only
to materials that the paper authors or repository maintainers have rights to
license, and it does not relicense publication PDFs, public-source datasets,
public code archives, vendor file-format structures, or third-party
materials.

## Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International

Author-created repository documentation, package metadata, source-decision
notes, data dictionaries, manifests, and rights-cleared derived package
metadata are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This license also covers author-created derived MCD analysis workbooks,
workbook-sheet CSV exports, regression-result tables, factor-loading tables,
correlation tables, chart-source tables, and accessibility/network-measure
analysis tables in `data/derived_mcd_analysis/` only to the extent they
consist of author-created selection, cleaning, integration, tabulation,
formulas, or analysis controlled by the paper authors or repository
maintainers.

## Materials Not Relicensed

This repository license does not apply to:

- The publication PDF under `paper/`, which retains its publisher,
  repository, or manuscript terms.
- MetroGIS, US Census TIGER/Line, ACS/Census, TAZ accessibility inputs,
  municipal-boundary files, road-network source files, and other
  public-source or institutional source data.
- The SOUND tree/circuit classification software and related UMN DRUM archive
  at https://hdl.handle.net/11299/181333, which retain their own archive
  terms and are cited here rather than duplicated.
- ArcGIS, Stata, Microsoft Excel, LibreOffice, OpenXML, CSV, or other
  vendor/runtime/file-format structures and application metadata.
- Drafts, review letters, submission files, generated figure files, cited
  references, and other third-party or externally controlled materials.

## Software Boundary

No executable software, scripts, notebooks, model source code, Stata do-files,
SOUND source code, GIS processing scripts, or paper-specific runtime code are
staged in this repository. This root license therefore grants no separate
software license.
